# The agent CLI versions the FP lab installs and records. KEY=version, one
# per line, no quotes and no expansion: deploy_owned_posture*.sh read it
# (`agents` installs exactly these, `record` writes the installed versions
# beside them) and run_fp_lab.py's preflight copies it into preflight.json.
#
# Chosen 2026-11-09 from the versions the lab windows drove that day:
# Claude Code 2.1.312 (test-mint's windows, ~/.local/share/claude/versions)
# and Codex 0.165.0 (the same windows, the registry's latest when the
# tarball installer ran; fmba-3 and shiawase were still on the 0.160.0 of
# 2026-10-22). The fleet E2E (agent_monitoring_e2e.yml) installs both
# unpinned. Bump both here, in one change, after a lab window on the new
# versions; the npm package versions follow the CLIs' own.
CLAUDE_CODE_NPM_VERSION=2.1.312
CODEX_NPM_VERSION=0.165.0
